# Implementation Plan - Advance (Modern Agrarian Capital)

Wiring all 19 provided UI screens from `/design` (covering Seller, Lender, and Admin portals) into a fully functional, interactive Decentralized Invoice Financing & Micro-Liquidity dApp targeting the Monad blockchain ecosystem.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> - **Zero Redesign Guarantee**: All 19 screens will preserve exact typography (`Plus Jakarta Sans`, `Inter`), color palette (`#16324f` Deep Space Blue, `#475569` Blue Slate, `#e08a00` Amber Earth, `#faf8f5` Bright Snow, `#059669` Shamrock Green), layout structure, and micro-interactions specified in `design.md` and the HTML files.
> - **Unified State Engine**: Actions in any portal (e.g. Seller submits invoice, Admin approves KYC/Invoice, Lender funds invoice/batch) immediately cascade across all three portals in real-time.
> - **Monad Blockchain Readiness**: Includes Monad testnet wallet connection support and contract abstraction for invoice tokenization and pool funding.

## Open Questions

> [!NOTE]
> No blocking open questions at this time. Default mock seed data will be pre-populated for immediate demonstration of active marketplace invoices, lender portfolios, and admin verification queues.

